This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/validate-claude-rules.sh, which is not shipped to consumers, and
the `.claude/rules/` authoring rulebook it guards, which exists only in this repo --
install.sh never writes that path. A fixture whose subject is absent cannot fail on the
consumer's tree, and a unit that cannot fail scores as a pass in the consumer's own suite
verdict.

It is also a MUTATION BATTERY: it builds seven throwaway repos per run and edits copies of
the validator's own corpus.
